# Applied to every Maven invocation in this project, local and in Docker.
#
# The presence of this .mvn directory also marks the reactor root, which is what
# makes ${maven.multiModuleProjectDirectory} resolve reliably — the parent POM
# uses it to locate the PMD ruleset and SpotBugs exclusion filter.
#
# Maven Central occasionally drops a connection mid-handshake, which surfaces as
# "Remote host terminated the handshake / SSL peer shut down incorrectly" and
# fails a build for reasons that have nothing to do with the code. The defaults
# do not retry that class of failure at all.
-Dmaven.wagon.http.retryHandler.count=5
-Dmaven.wagon.http.retryHandler.requestSentEnabled=true
-Dmaven.wagon.httpconnectionManager.ttlSeconds=60
-Dmaven.wagon.rto=120000
